that was swept off the roof during winter.

00:45:05.069 --> 00:45:08.005
So that will take a while before it's
gone.

00:45:08.005 --> 00:45:09.840
But, yeah, another cold week.

00:45:09.840 --> 00:45:12.976
And then I think slowly
things will be warming up.

